                                        "entry_id": "eaad4ea4-b7ad-3f5d-9ffc-d651b6e1cc21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To point to another document by a hyperlink."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a hypertext document"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c7423616-2e50-4ada-8ca3-5a25d4f03531",
                                                "sense_id": "a65c87ee-490f-35cb-a7a0-aa10ea94b500",
                                                "text": "Their Web page hyperlinks to your Web site."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e82755d-08ce-3992-977b-d027a0be6ad6",
                                        "entry_id": "eaad4ea4-b7ad-3f5d-9ffc-d651b6e1cc21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To add a hyperlink to a document."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ecebd56-32a4-43a0-aab2-5278e940c43f",
                                                "sense_id": "8e82755d-08ce-3992-977b-d027a0be6ad6",
                                                "text": "One valuable thing a blogger often does is hyperlink to magazine and newspaper stories or other interesting blogs, she says."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20314f20-3b68-3723-9b69-a041c08bb5fb",
                                        "entry_id": "eaad4ea4-b7ad-3f5d-9ffc-d651b6e1cc21",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To use a hyperlink to jump to a document."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45edc544-8711-4b34-b6e5-95e8ddd48da6",
                                                "sense_id": "20314f20-3b68-3723-9b69-a041c08bb5fb",
                                                "text": "Indeed, what consumers will see on a Web site is likely to vary depending on the point or Web page at which they access the Web site, how many pages they “hyperlink” through when reviewing the site, and how much of the page containing the disclosure is displayed by consumers' Web browsers without requiring additional scrolling."
                                            }
